{
  "name": "plink-server",
  "version": "1.5.2",
  "type": "module",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20.6.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "tsx watch --env-file=.env src/server.ts",
    "build": "prisma generate && tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "start": "./node_modules/.bin/prisma migrate deploy && node dist/server.js",
    "test": "vitest",
    "test:integration": "node scripts/assert-redis-url.mjs && vitest run src/tests/integration",
    "test:ci": "vitest run --coverage",
    "test:coverage": "vitest run --coverage",
    "prisma:generate": "prisma generate",
    "prisma:migrate": "prisma migrate dev",
    "prisma:push": "prisma db push",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "lint:fix": "eslint . --fix",
    "format": "prettier --write .",
    "format:check": "prettier --check ."
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@fastify/cors": "^11.0.0",
    "@fastify/jwt": "^10.2.1",
    "@fastify/rate-limit": "^10.0.0",
    "@fastify/websocket": "^11.0.0",
    "@opentelemetry/api": "^1.9.0",
    "@prisma/client": "^5.22.0",
    "@sentry/node": "^10.71.0",
    "@types/qrcode": "^1.5.6",
    "bcryptjs": "^3.0.3",
    "fastify": "^5.11.3",
    "ioredis": "^5.4.1",
    "jose": "^6.2.3",
    "nanoid": "^5.0.9",
    "pino-pretty": "^13.1.3",
    "prisma": "5.22.0",
    "prom-client": "^15.1.3",
    "qrcode": "^1.5.4",
    "sharp": "^0.35.3",
    "tsx": "^4.19.2",
    "ws": "^8.18.0",
    "zod": "^3.23.8"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@eslint/js": "^10.0.1",
    "@types/bcryptjs": "^2.4.6",
    "@types/node": "^22.10.0",
    "@types/ws": "^8.5.13",
    "@vitest/coverage-v8": "^4.1.10",
    "eslint": "^10.8.1",
    "prettier": "^3.9.6",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3",
    "typescript-eslint": "^8.67.0",
    "vitest": "^4.1.10"
  },
  "comment:overrides": [
    "Six high-severity advisories resolve inside fastify's own transitive tree.",
    "Upgrading fastify does not clear them: 5.11.3 (latest) still pulls",
    "find-my-way@9.6.0 and resolves fast-uri@3.1.3, both affected versions.",
    "",
    "fast-uri <3.1.5      — host confusion: a backslash is treated as an",
    "                       authority delimiter. Reached via",
    "                       fastify -> @fastify/ajv-compiler -> ajv and",
    "                       fastify -> @fastify/fast-json-stringify-compiler.",
    "find-my-way <=9.6.0  — HTTP/2 denial of service. Direct fastify dependency.",
    "",
    "Both pins are semver-compatible, no major bumps: fastify asks for ^9.6.0",
    "(9.7.0 satisfies it), ajv and fast-json-stringify ask for ^3.0.x (3.1.5",
    "satisfies it). Drop this block once fastify raises the floor itself, and",
    "re-run npm audit to confirm."
  ],
  "overrides": {
    "fast-uri": "^3.1.5",
    "find-my-way": "^9.7.0"
  }
}
